 percent of their life as a  female is wrong we're encouraging that  we're celebrating that then sobble is  praising this and it's absolutely wrong  and sending the wrong message to young  girls  um to pass female athletes who had to  fight for Title IX and to present female  athletes  what has been the media reaction you  said you have gotten a lot of support  and I've seen some of that unfold even  when I announced that I was going to be  talking to you today there were a lot of  people who were really excited and very  supportive of what you've been saying  um what has the negative reaction have  you heard from woke media have you  gotten messages you know what does that  look like  um because we have to be realistic you  know somebody who does come out and  speak out like you is going to face the  rash of people who just don't like to  scent in any in any respect what does  that look like for you and has that in  any way ever made you regret your  decision to speak out  no I definitely don't regret my decision  um but actually I've gotten one of the  comments I've gotten a lot is you only  do right wing media you'll only go on  Fox News blah blah blah  um I've actually reached out to  different left-winged media to just  increase the audience who hears my  message and I have been shot down by  every single one of them they are not  willing to have this conversation with  me  um  and so I think a lot of my support has  been because I'm preaching to people who  already agree with me but when trying to  speak with people who don't it doesn't  get me very far because people aren't  willing to listen  um I actually went on Dr Phil last I  think I don't I don't think it's aired  yet but I did it last week to try and  increase that audience because I think  it's important I think more people who  are  um kind of on the fence on the political  Spectrum which I hate that this is even  political  um they need to hear this they need to  hear the facts behind this because I